# José Claudinho — Cursor project rules

This file is a **thin adapter**. The canonical, host-neutral agent guidance is
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root — read it first. Do not duplicate
policy text here; update `AGENTS.md` instead.

Key hard constraints (see AGENTS.md for the full list):

- **Read-and-recommend only** — never add Sport5 write/transfer APIs.
- **Credentials in the tracked `.env` only** — never scatter cookies into source or docs.
- **Game rules live in `mcp-server/src/rules.ts`** — single source of truth.
- **Build gate:** `cd mcp-server && npm run typecheck && npm run build`; commit `dist/index.js`.
